WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:06.100
Should I have called you back sooner?

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.610
It's April now, so the cherry 
blossoms have started falling.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.120
Oh, no.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.490
Anyway, what's the situation like?

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.100
At the moment, neither we nor Gaia 
are making any major moves.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.630
And neither is the Key.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:20.620
The Key...

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.700
It always returns to where it was 
born after its incubation period.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.750
Our best bet is to cast a wide net over 
this area, but we lack the manpower.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.260
Are you sure you want me?

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.380
I was nothing but dead weight over there.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.740
You never change, do you?

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.520
That said, you're fine the way you are.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:15.530
Episode 21
"Reunion"

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.750
<i>When Yasmin and I looked into the Key,</i>

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.360
<i>what we found was terrifying.</i>

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.580
<i>Once it is birthed from the 
earth in the form of a human,</i>

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.490
<i>the Key travels the world with its own legs</i>

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.960
<i>and investigates humanity, 
Earth's tenants, so to speak.</i>

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.510
<i>And when the time comes for 
it to pass its judgment,</i>

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:36.170
<i>it causes massive destruction 
with itself at the epicenter.</i>

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:45.480
It couldn't be...

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.820
She's not here, huh?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.320
Of course she's not.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:03.700
Wait, she called me here?

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.970
You're the Key, aren't you?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:13.780
Kagari.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:16.200
Kagari?

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.740
<i>It was the first time I'd 
ever heard that name,</i>

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.310
<i>but for some reason,</i>

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.590
<i>it felt familiar and sounded 
like music to my ears.</i>

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:25.850
Tennouji Kotarou.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:32.070
The planet's memories are all too 
wrought with sadness right now.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:36.290
If that doesn't change, 
all of it will fall to ruin.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.240
Ruin?

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.870
W-Wait a minute!

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.740
It'll fall to ruin? All of it?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.440
You mean all of Earth?

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.650
Normally, ruin would be 
followed by re-evolution,

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:49.370
but Earth currently lacks 
the vitality to support that.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.250
Re-evolution?

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:55.290
Starting over from scratch and 
repeating history as much as possible

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.620
until intelligent life is born again.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.370
However, as the consumption of 
natural resources has increased,

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:04.350
the vitality of the planet has dwindled.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.640
In this state, there will be no 
re-evolution, even after ruin.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.520
And what happens then?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.890
The planet dies.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:15.400
That's quite the bomb 
to drop out of the blue.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.330
Why'd you choose to tell me?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.150
Because you and I have formed a link.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.170
Nobody else can see me.

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.160
Did it happen when I let you go?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.160
We came in contact when I was sprouting, too.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.650
That was the first thing I ever learned.

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:34.120
I believe what you did

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:38.530
was an expression of either love or devotion.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:39.540
Th-That was...

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:43.760
In other words, you desire me.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.580
Wait, wait, wait!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.810
Uh...

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.730
You're the one who'll bring about 
that "ruin" or whatever, right?

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.640
Is there any way I can get you to reconsider?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:59.050
Ruin occurs naturally when I become filled

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:01.070
with sad memories.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.150
There is only one way to stop it:

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.780
fond memories.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:07.100
Fond memories? Such as?

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.770
I don't know.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.480
All I can say is that they're 
memories that I'd be fond of.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:16.290
And I need a servant in order 
to influence the Homo sapiens.

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.170
Servant?

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.320
I seek your help as my means to that end.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.920
Bring me fond memories.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.030
As your reward,

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.140
I don't mind satisfying your carnal desire.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:29.900
Hey!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:31.810
Don't go adding misleading adjectives.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.060
S-So, like, would you let 
me fondle your breasts?

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.310
If you help save this planet,

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:42.050
I will even fornicate with you, 
in the worst-case scenario.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.570
Did you have to call that 
the worst-case scenario?

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:47.570
Also, your name will go down in history

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:52.000
as "the man who saved the planet and fondled

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.200
Kagari's breasts as a reward."

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.820
I'd rather stay anonymous!

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:00.580
Save the planet, huh?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.130
Help

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.130
Refuse

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.000
Help

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.720
Sure, I'll help out.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.990
Are you sure?

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:08.280
I won't go back on my word.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.720
Where do we stand right now?

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:12.050
There isn't a moment to waste.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.180
We must find fond memories 
as soon as possible

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.850
and prevent the re-evolution.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.900
Fond memories, huh?

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.060
I honestly have no idea what they could be,

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.390
but we've gotta do this.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:28.110
Unfortunately, I don't understand 
humans enough to define it for you.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:31.680
But I do feel like one of the 
major causes of sad memories

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.740
is conflict between fellow Homo sapiens.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.480
Conflict, huh?

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:39.320
Will stopping one bring you a fond memory?

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:41.590
What if it wasn't a tiny conflict,

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.500
but one involving the whole world?

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.260
<i>Like the one between Gaia and Guardian?</i>

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.370
<i>Can I really pull it off?</i>

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:52.180
<i>No, I'm the only one who can.</i>

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.220
<i>I've engaged with both groups,</i>

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.180
<i>but I have never truly felt 
like I belonged in either.</i>

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.440
<i>And I'm the only one.</i>

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:03.420
<i>Going up against such massive 
organizations is positively insane.</i>

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.630
<i>But...</i>

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.520
Kagari, how about you and I

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:10.200
try preventing the planet's death?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.990
That has always been my desire.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.620
Is that you, Tennouji?

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.280
Who else would I be?

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.450
You seem like a different person.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:27.630
Right back at you.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.010
The important areas to keep an eye on

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.930
are the station and the main road 
passing through the heart of the city.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.330
Then there's the temple area.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.080
There're lots of targets to monitor,

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.520
but the most crucial one is, of course...

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.460
The Key.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.880
I hear there's a superhuman who can see it?

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.810
Remember Oonishi from Team Mikuni? It's him.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:47.650
Oonishi?

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:51.540
Oh, him?

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:53.160
Okay.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.910
How about I handle this low-priority area?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.540
Yeah, the forest area shouldn't be a problem.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.060
But don't go around hunting 
monsters, okay, Great Hero?

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.290
Imamiya.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:05.640
I know.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.080
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.420
I'll focus on keeping watch.

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:10.990
I'm pretty good at menial tasks.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.300
You've grown in your own way, huh?

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.710
<i>I'm glad I came here first, Imamiya.</i>

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.810
<i>I got permission to act alone and 
gained some classified info...</i>

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:23.740
<i>Presents too good for a traitor like me.</i>

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.260
<i>I set the table so I could operate freely.</i>

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:32.180
<i>I even got a safe house 
in case I ever needed it.</i>

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:35.660
<i>Next up...</i>

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.220
<i>Gaia fanatics share several common features.</i>

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.410
<i>They lack confidence, hate the world,</i>

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:49.270
<i>and are passive folks who 
find life itself oppressive.</i>

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.830
<i>Yeah, folks just like me.</i>

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:56.610
<i>As such, I didn't even need to put on an act.</i>

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:59.470
<i>You could say it was only 
natural that they picked me.</i>

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:05.580
All of you here must have 
given up on this world

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:09.050
and entrusted your hopes and 
dreams to your next life.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.160
To that end,

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:14.950
your need to purify your 
life down to its very core.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.390
And this is how you do it.

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:24.280
Behold this monster,

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.120
which has taken such a ghastly form

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.520
simply because I offered 
it some of my spirit.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:32.630
This is proof that all of 
humanity's souls are corrupt.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.130
So our souls really are tainted?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.230
We can't keep living in this world.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.810
But at the same time,

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:42.890
monsters are also a manifestation of 
the noble desire to reform the world.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:46.650
If they make the world a better place

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:50.520
and purify tainted lives in the process,

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.150
you couldn't call it anything 
but genuine salvation.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.470
My kindred spirits.

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.160
Join me in walking the path to salvation.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:01.620
<i>I began training in the summoning arts.</i>

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.410
<i>The first step toward becoming a summoner</i>

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.910
<i>is to connect your life to a monster</i>

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.920
<i>in what is called a contract.</i>

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.430
<i>The contract link...</i>

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:21.400
<i>Proof that my life force took root in 
something as a fleeting form of life.</i>

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.310
<i>The next step is gaining experience.</i>

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:26.930
<i>You form contracts with 
monsters and control them.</i>

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.090
<i>If the contract link snaps,</i>

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.860
<i>you lose control of the monster.</i>

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.900
<i>An animal-type would die 
pretty much instantly,</i>

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.660
<i>but since insect-types are low-maintenance,</i>

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.500
<i>they go around doing as 
they please for a while.</i>

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.200
<i>I digress,</i>

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.600
<i>but the rumor that UMAs 
showed up in the forest</i>

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.670
<i>was caused by out-of-control 
monsters like these.</i>

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:55.870
<i>Anyway, it seems I'm not 
a very talented summoner.</i>

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:59.660
<i>I'm no match for Yasmin and the rest, 
who picked it up all by themselves.</i>

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.350
<i>The last step is creation.</i>

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.530
<i>As its name implies,</i>

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.850
<i>it involves creating a whole 
new monster from scratch.</i>

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:10.420
<i>It's supposed to be far more difficult 
than only controlling one...</i>

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.800
<i>But I actually pulled it off,
surprising even myself.</i>

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.610
<i>And with this...</i>

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.950
<i>I became an official member of Gaia.</i>

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:32.550
I've infiltrated Martel... Gaia.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.500
I'm going to start investigating 
their internal affairs.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:38.250
If possible, I'd like to get them 
to stop investigating you.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.220
You think we have time for that?

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:43.260
Prepare to eliminate Gaia at once.

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.940
Kagari, don't ask for the impossible.

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:48.770
I'm not some all-conquering hero.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.890
Then strengthen yourself.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:56.270
Do you think I'm blind?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:00.480
I know you have the power 
to alter your abilities.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:04.530
Do that and destroy Gaia, then Guardian.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:12.320
Why do you keep asking for the impossible?

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.920
Besides, that ability...

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:18.550
Then I shall bring judgment down 
upon Gaia and Guardian myself.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.200
No need to worry.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:23.210
Homo sapiens cannot see me.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:25.550
You think it's that easy?

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:29.560
There are humans and monsters 
that can perceive you.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:33.300
You have great power, but 
you're not suited for combat.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.310
You don't even have a 
shred of battle awareness.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.590
There's no time.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.690
Why won't things go my way?

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.940
I'll work it out somehow.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.960
It may take a little while,

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.330
but please believe me.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.510
I won't ever betray you.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:49.790
Of course not.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.200
Betrayal is not an option.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.370
Kagari,

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:58.280
what happened here?

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.560
These things took it out.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.140
Just to make sure,

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.090
this is the first time, right?

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.250
I have 7,548 records of eliminating things

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.650
that dared to approach me.

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:11.790
Are you stupid?!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.290
Don't go around killing Gaia's monsters!

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.760
It'll make it obvious that 
something's hidden here!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.850
If they determine that the Key's here,

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:22.610
both Gaia and Guardian will 
carry out special operations!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:24.990
And everything will be done for in a flash!

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:28.280
Can humans really work together that quickly?

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.480
Do you have any idea how many times 
the Key has been killed in history?

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:34.320
Humans are by far the best 
creatures at detecting

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.450
and hunting alien objects.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:41.400
Please tell me you haven't killed any people.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.880
I would never take Homo 
sapiens' lives for no reason.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.460
Got it.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:49.390
Please try to hide from those 
things or something from now on.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.350
I fail to understand.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.640
How can humans be so 
intelligent and perceptive

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.630
and yet fail to create fond memories?

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:01.260
Why have they stagnated like this?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.290
Seriously...

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.280
Why, indeed?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.250
I don't know the answer, either.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.990
<i>Suzaki Shuuichirou, 52 years old.</i>

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.210
<i>A Martel Group Japan leader who 
controls all of its business interests</i>

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.650
<i>and is the major driving 
force behind its prosperity.</i>

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.280
Most of the people who come to Martel

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:29.680
seek escape from this world.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:32.310
Aren't you the same, Suzuki-kun?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.310
Yes, that's right.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:40.680
B-But now that I know 
I have a power like that,

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:45.280
I, uh, think there must 
be something I can do.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:49.120
You mean to say you wish to climb the ladder?

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.530
Oh?

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.410
<i>Unlike the Saint faction, Kashima 
Sakura's world-weary worshipers,</i>

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.540
<i>the Suzaki faction places importance 
on making profits in this world.</i>

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:03.340
<i>Using their nature made it easy to get 
close to him, even as a complete newbie.</i>

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.320
Martel has become a massive organization.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.340
And that has led to frequent 
leaks of information.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.220
You want me to run an internal investigation?

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.020
I'm not about to ask an 
amateur to do an expert's job.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.410
All you have to do is pay 
attention to any rumors

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:22.320
and give me your frank opinions.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.110
Of course, if you can figure it out, 
nothing would be better.

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:27.930
<i>So his target is the Saint faction.</i>

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.920
<i>He wants to weaken Kashima Sakura's 
hold on the organization.</i>

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:31.930
Got it.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.490
I'll do everything I can.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.620
Use these monsters.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.930
They're plant-types whose 
metabolism requires no oxygen,

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.070
so they won't reduce your 
lifespan much at all.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:47.380
And use this to make your preparations.

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.260
Thank you very much.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.620
<i>The Saint faction and the Suzaki faction.</i>

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.480
<i>If I can use this divide for something...</i>

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.180
Damn!

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.640
She really isn't here!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:05.460
She usually shows up even 
if I don't say anything.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:07.520
But there's no sign of her 
at all, which means...

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:12.760
Doesn't she realize it's game over 
the moment she gets found?!

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:16.910
I didn't think I'd have to 
use these guys so soon.

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.360
They don't have the best eyesight,

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.040
but they have an excellent sense of smell.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.790
They're perfect for the job.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:26.290
Go after the greenest scent you can find!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.210
That's Kagari!

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.800
I can't believe you did that!

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.220
Why would you go into town?!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:39.810
It was to increase my 
understanding of Homo sapiens.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.700
I determined that it would 
help me achieve my goals.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:46.440
What's the point if you have to walk 
into your enemies' crosshairs to do it?!

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.510
Do not get hostile with me.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:51.540
I'm mad because I'm worried about you!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:55.820
I'm hesitating right now.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.650
I don't know if I should go 
along with your decisions.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:00.490
Don't you want to save the planet?

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.360
Yes, but we remain at a standstill.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:06.330
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.730
Please!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.270
Very well.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:12.730
I'll wait.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:15.830
Thanks.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.870
Don't let me down.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.560
<i>I'm upset.</i>

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.060
<i>I know.</i>

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:31.180
<i>You never get back to me.</i>

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:34.340
<i>This is data of monsters, from 
the contract phase to creation.</i>

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.580
<i>I want you all to investigate this.</i>

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.940
<i>Let me know if you find something, anything.</i>

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:40.760
<i>Everybody is worried about you.</i>

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:41.940
<i>I want you out of this.</i>

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.190
<i>We're a family!</i>

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:46.840
<i>I've paid you up front.</i>

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.870
<i>Please confirm the transaction.</i>

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.130
<i>I'm worried about you.</i>

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.550
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:53.500
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.530
<i>I want to see you.</i>

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.140
<i>I checked the data.</i>

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:03.230
<i>It contains information about 
transforming life to suit humanity.</i>

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.790
<i>It's terrifying.</i>

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.700
<i>Can you analyze it?</i>

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.390
<i>If you say so.</i>

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.190
<i>But I'm scared.</i>

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.780
<i>I feel like getting involved in 
this stuff is a very bad idea.</i>

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.110
I'll keep that in mind.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.290
Worried, huh?

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.300
<i>What's this?</i>

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:43.050
W-Wait!

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:47.810
Y-You're Kotarou-kun, right?

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.540
Is that you, Kotori?

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:55.450
Did you put up that barrier 
or whatever, Kotori?

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:59.070
Why are you two together?

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.960
Well...

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:05.830
<i>Three years ago,</i>

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.580
<i>on the day I left home,</i>

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:09.830
<i>the Kanbes got into an 
accident in the mountains.</i>

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:12.800
<i>Kotori was the only one who survived it,</i>

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.490
<i>and she inherited the power of the Druids,</i>

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:18.340
<i>ancient summoners who worshipped Kagari,</i>

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:22.140
<i>along with the duty of protecting her.</i>

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.090
<i>And then...</i>

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.410
<i>Kotori and Kagari met two years ago,</i>

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:28.770
<i>on the very same day I met 
Kagari, strangely enough.</i>

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.670
<i>She'd been regularly visiting her ever since,</i>

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.230
<i>but somehow we'd managed to 
miss each other until this day.</i>

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:36.410
<i>Funny, right?</i>

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.240
<i>Well, no.</i>

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.270
<i>Not in the least.</i>

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.160
Is this...

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:52.900
I've been hiding Kagari-san 
within a barrier here.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:55.920
But she never stays in one place.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:59.760
So I was reinforcing the barrier today, 
and that's when you showed up.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.880
You've been protecting 
Kagari all this time, huh?

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.620
If I didn't,

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:08.060
I wouldn't have gained the 
power to save Mom and Dad.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:09.430
I see.

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.510
Hang on, Kotori.

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.750
Keisuke-san and Rikako-san

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.830
died, right?

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.580
Yeah, but they came back to life.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:22.450
Though they're still a bit awkward.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.450
<i>Wait, does that mean...</i>

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:26.060
You contracted with them?

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.070
You turned human remains into monsters?!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.060
What are you thinking, you 
complete and utter moron?!

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:35.120
You can't call that coming back to life!

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.470
They're just monsters!

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.630
Zombies!

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:39.790
That's not true.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:44.470
It'll take them some time, but someday...

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.800
The dead will never come back to life!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.000
You're a smart girl,

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.400
so you should understand that 
you're doing something wrong!

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.890
How am I supposed to understand?!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.320
This girl will surely protect me.

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:03.030
That will allow you to throw yourself 
into conflict free of concern for me.

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:04.390
Screw you!

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.040
Don't drag a child into this!

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.530
Free Kotori right now and send her home!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.790
If the planet dies, so will everyone 
on it, be they adults or children.

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.950
That's not what we're talking about!

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.420
Anyway, I'm taking Kotori back ho—

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.290
I'm not going!

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:21.410
I don't know what your reasons 
are for being with Kagari-san,

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:23.920
but I have my own reasons for being here!

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.430
You don't realize how 
dangerous this is, do you?

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:28.350
I do.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.640
You don't.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.430
I do.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.790
You definitely don't.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:32.890
I do, too.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.690
Forget it.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.030
Get lost.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:38.690
And don't bother responding.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.820
Kotarou-kun?

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.020
You have no business being here.

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:45.240
If you refuse to leave, I'll drag you—

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:47.680
Why?

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:50.400
I've had to endure nothing but 
one sad thing after another!

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:52.830
Why can't you be a little nicer to me?!

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:55.500
This is how we've always been.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:59.270
Are you telling me to live 
with nobody on my side?!

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:06.380
Mom and Dad were the only ones 
who were ever nice to me!

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:12.770
<i>This was the second time I saw Kotori cry,</i>

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>and I never expected it to hurt so much.</i>

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:22.310
<i>If Earth does fall into ruin 
in the future and we all die,</i>

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:25.820
<i>I just hope the last thing I see before I go</i>

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:28.450
<i>isn't a girl's tears.</i>
